+ PathCurveReader

+ span PathCommandSpan
+ command-index Index
+ next-curve-index Index
+ curve-index Index
+ type SegmentType
+ is-close = false
+ x1 Coord
+ y1 Coord
+ handle-out-x Coord
+ handle-out-y Coord
+ handle-in-x Coord
+ handle-in-y Coord
+ x2 Coord
